ween professional names and actual educational content, which is relevant to the context but not the main concern.\n\nBased on the analysis, the correct answer is A) The major catalogue of secondary vocational education in china needs to be adjusted according to the actual post demand. This option addresses the main concern of the paragraph, which is the mismatch between professional names and actual blue-collar jobs.\n</think>\n<answer>\nA) The major catalogue of secondary vocational education in china needs to be adjusted according to the actual post demand.\n</answer>",
