messages:  [['Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D. Please reason step by step.\n####\n# Context:\nUndifferentiated marketing refers to that enterprises do not consider the characteristics of each sub-market, but only pay attention to the commonness of the market, decide to launch a single product, use a single marketing mix, and strive to meet the needs of as many customers as possible to a certain extent.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, according to the above definition, which of the following is undifferentiated marketing?\n# Options:\nA) Cosmetic products company through market research found that no one to whiten the characteristics of the middle and low grade cosmetics production, so the development of a whitening features cosmetics, and promote in the market\nB) An enterprise found that the health care products produced by other enterprises could achieve high profits, so it imitated them and produced similar products\nC) A multinational company, although very large, produces only one beverage and uses the same packaging and advertising in all regions of the world\nD) After market analysis, an enterprise found that people in a also prefer to drink instant coffee, so it sold a large amount of instant coffee originally planned to be sold in china to country a. the packaging and price of coffee were exactly the same as those sold in china', '. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
