onsistent with the constraints.\n- Option D (Zhao and Sun) is consistent with the constraints.\n\nSince all options are consistent with the constraints, we need to choose the one that is most likely based on the information provided. Given the constraints, it seems that any combination of two people can attend the meeting as long as they satisfy the individual constraints.\n\nTherefore, my final option is:  D) Zhao and sun. \n</think>\n<answer>\nD) Zhao and sun\n</answer>",
      "logprobs": null,
