ive anti-wrinkle, rejuvenating drug. This is because it directly addresses the potential confounding factor of pre-existing conditions and provides a fair comparison between the two groups.\n</think>\n<answer>\nA) The eye corner skins of the two groups of subjects were comparable before the experiment.\n</answer>",
