ivorce formalities, Sun married another non-local woman, and Zhou also married a man from a neighboring village.\n\n- Sun and Zhou were married for a year.\n- Sun married another woman without going through the divorce formalities.\n- Zhou married a man from a neighboring village without going through the divorce formalities.\n- This does not fit the definition of bigamy because both Sun and Zhou were married to someone else.\n\nBased on the analysis, the correct options are A and B. However, since the question asks for a single answer, I will choose the first option listed, which is A.\n</think>\n<answer>\nA\n</answer>",
