fore, the correct answer is D) In speed skating competitions, athletes often advance in the shape of people. one athlete is in the front, followed by three others, and the last three players benefit from reduced resistance.\n</think>\n<answer>\nD) In speed skating competitions, athletes often advance in the shape of people. one athlete is in the front, followed by three others, and the last three players benefit from reduced resistance.\n</answer>",
