cates have evening obligations, but it does not provide any information about the status of non-high school graduates.\n\n4. **Conclusion:**\n   - Based on the analysis, the correct answer is **Option C**. Most of the workers who have earned the certificate are high school graduates.\n</think>\n<answer>\nC) Most of the workers who have earned the certificate are high school graduates.\n</answer>",
