on C suggests improving diesel quality standards and using price monitoring methods to encourage the production of high-quality diesel. This option focuses on improving the quality of diesel rather than promoting the development of advanced diesel vehicles.\n\n9. Option D emphasizes enhancing the independent innovation capability of advanced diesel technology and developing advanced diesel vehicles. This option directly supports the statement about the environmental benefits of advanced diesel vehicles.\n\nBased on the analysis, option D is the best choice as it directly supports the statement about the environmental benefits of advanced diesel vehicles.\n</think>\n<answer>\nD) Enhance the independent innovation capability of advanced diesel technology and develop advanced diesel vehicles.\n</answer>",
