 Zhao Ming.)\n  - Option B: B, A, E, C, D (This does not include E, D, C, A, B as predicted by Zhao Ming.)\n  - Option C: E, D, A, B, C (This includes E, D, A, B, C as predicted by Zhao Ming and fits the criteria of Qian Liang's prediction.)\n  - Option D: C, D, E, A, B (This does not include E, D, C, A, B as predicted by Zhao Ming.)\n\n### Conclusion\nBased on the analysis, the correct ranking of the five sprinters is:\n\\boxed{C} E, D, A, B, C.\n</think>\n<answer>\nC) E, D, A, B, C.\n</answer>",
