ealthy and happy life.\n\nBased on the analysis, the correct option is C) If a person does not adhere to the spirit of self-discipline, he will indulge himself.\n</think>\n<answer>\nC) If a person does not adhere to the spirit of self-discipline, he will indulge himself.\n</answer>",
