messages:  [["Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D. Please reason step by step.\n####\n# Context:\nThe older a tree is, the more its rings are. The locust trees in Lao Zhang's yard are older than those in Lao Li's house. Therefore, the locust trees in Lao Zhang's house have more rings than those in Lao Li's house,\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, which of the following reasonings is most similar to the problem stem??\n# Options:\nA) The older a man is, the more mature he becomes. lao zhang is older than his son, so lao zhang is more mature than his son\nB) The higher the altitude, the thinner the air. because the altitude of xining is higher than xi'an, the air in xining is thinner than xi'an\nC) This year's marathon champion's performance is better than the year before last. zhang hua is this year's marathon champion, so his marathon performance this year is better than that of the year before last\nD) In the highly competitive market, the higher the product quality and the more advertising investment, the greater the product demand. company a invests more advertising expenses than company b. therefore, the demand for company a's products is greater than that of company b", '. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
