estone and clay, but it does not mention oil as one of the basic ingredients.\n\nBased on the analysis, the correct option is B) Oil is a source of energy for some of the kilns used in the making of cement.\n</think>\n<answer>\nB) Oil is a source of energy for some of the kilns used in the making of cement.\n</answer>",
