crease, which could potentially increase the cost of the detergents for consumers. However, this does not directly support the prediction made by the market analysts.\n\nBased on the analysis, option C is the most strongly supported by the information provided and most likely to lead to the prediction made by the market analysts.\n</think>\n<answer>\nC) Consumers are increasingly being persuaded by environmental concerns to buy concentrated detergents when available in order to reduce cardboard waste.\n</answer>",
