imes in more than one neighborhood.\n\nBased on the analysis, the correct answer is A) Fails to consider the possibility that police presence in a particular area is often a response to the relatively high crime rate in that area.\n</think>\n<answer>\nA) Fails to consider the possibility that police presence in a particular area is often a response to the relatively high crime rate in that area.\n</answer>",
