messages:  [['Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D. Please reason step by step.\n####\n# Context:\nThe root of economic recovery is industrial recovery, especially under the framework of the global division of labor system, the economies of various countries are no longer committed to building a large and comprehensive production system, but focus on strengthening the worldwide comparative advantage. And in the process of global transmission of the crisis along the industrial chain, there are differences in the degree of damage to different industries. Therefore, timely, moderate and specific industrial policies are of great significance for countries to get out of the crisis.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, which of the following options is the gist of this passage?\n# Options:\nA) Introduce the methods and ways to promote economic recovery.\nB) Emphasize the need to specify targeted industrial policies for economic recovery.\nC) Explain the characteristics of the economic situation and industrial structure.\nD) This paper expounds how to realize the differential industrial regulation and control.', '. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
