messages:  [['Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D. Please reason step by step.\n####\n# Context:\nThe survey shows that the biggest difficulty in the process of youth entrepreneurship is funding. 64.2% of people believe that lack of sufficient funds is the main difficulty. Many people are unwilling to borrow or raise funds despite the lack of funds. This reflects that many entrepreneurs are starting their own businesses. There is a conservative mentality in the process. Another prominent difficulty is excessive competition among peers, accounting for 26.9%. During the survey process, it was found that the field of youth entrepreneurship is relatively concentrated, such as college students who are more inclined to entrepreneurship in e-commerce, computer technology support, etc. Young farmers are more willing to engage in planting and breeding industries that they are more familiar with.This kind of homogenized entrepreneurship will inevitably bring excessive competition while forming a scale effect.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, which of the followings is consistent with the original text?\n# Options:\nA) Insufficient funds are the main factor in the failure of youth entrepreneurship.\nB) Financial services are insufficient to support young entrepreneurs.\nC) Homogeneous entrepreneurship reflects the conservative mentality of entrepreneurs.\nD) The field of youth entrepreneurship is concentrated in certain fixed industries.', '. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
