ntrepreneurship is concentrated in certain fixed industries.\n- This statement is consistent with the context. The context mentions that college students are more inclined to entrepreneurship in e-commerce, computer technology support, and young farmers are more willing to engage in planting and breeding industries that they are more familiar with.\n\nBased on the analysis, the correct answer is C) Homogeneous entrepreneurship reflects the conservative mentality of entrepreneurs.\n</think>\n<answer>\nC) Homogeneous entrepreneurship reflects the conservative mentality of entrepreneurs.\n</answer>",
