y employee of a telemarketing agency who tries to get someone to buy the product of a client of the agency after the person has said that he or she does not want to will engender animosity toward the client**. This option directly justifies the application of the principle by stating the consequence of the action described in the application.\n</think>\n<answer>\nB) Any employee of a telemarketing agency who tries to get someone to buy the product of a client of the agency after the person has said that he or she does not want to will engender animosity toward the client.\n</answer>",
