tions that analysis of contours and hatching styles can help distinguish works by different artists, it does not imply that these are the only features that distinguish their styles.\n\nBased on the analysis, the correct answer is B) There is an analyzable difference between Clovio's contour and hatching styles and those of Michelangelo.\n</think>\n<answer>\nB) There is an analyzable difference between Clovio's contour and hatching styles and those of Michelangelo.\n</answer>",
