messages:  [["Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D. Please reason step by step.\n####\n# Context:\nIf an official from the government environmental protection department wants to speak at this non-governmental environmental protection seminar, he must be a member of a non-governmental environmental protection organization. However, the meeting stipulated that as a member of a non-governmental environmental protection organization, he is not allowed to be both an official of the government environmental protection department and a speaker at this non-governmental environmental protection seminar.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, if the above assertion is true, which of the followings is also true?\n# Options:\nA) Among the speakers at this seminar, there are no officials from the government's environmental protection department.\nB) Only members of non-governmental environmental organizations can speak at this seminar\nC) Except for officials from the government's environmental protection department, no one spoke at this seminar\nD) Among the speakers at this seminar, there are no members of non-governmental environmental protection organizations.", '. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
