analysis, Option C is the one that directly weakens the consumer advocate's argument by providing evidence that the vitamin content of fruits and vegetables remains unchanged after irradiation. Therefore, the correct answer is:\n\n**C) A study showed that irradiation leaves the vitamin content of virtually all fruits and vegetables unchanged.**\n</think>\n<answer>\nC) A study showed that irradiation leaves the vitamin content of virtually all fruits and vegetables unchanged.\n</answer>",
