 embezzler's role within the company. Therefore, this option does not weaken the detective's argument.\n\nBased on the analysis, the option that weakens the detective's argument is B) There is evidence of breaches in computer security at the time of the embezzlement that could have given persons outside XYZ Corporation access to internal financial records.\n</think>\n<answer>\nB) There is evidence of breaches in computer security at the time of the embezzlement that could have given persons outside XYZ Corporation access to internal financial records.\n</answer>",
