alysis, the only option that aligns with the given information is Option D: \"We should enable more people to be both virtuous and talented.\"\n\nTherefore, my final answer is: **D) We should enable more people to be both virtuous and talented.**\n</think>\n<answer>\nD) We should enable more people to be both virtuous and talented.\n</answer>",
