cus of the argument.\n\nBased on the analysis, the correct answer is A) In deep-tillage farming, the deeper one tills, the greater the susceptibility to topsoil erosion.\n</think>\n<answer>\nA) In deep-tillage farming, the deeper one tills, the greater the susceptibility to topsoil erosion.\n</answer>",
