messages:  [["Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D. Please reason step by step.\n####\n# Context:\nImpression management refers to the process in which people try to manage and control others impressions of themselves. In general, people tend to present themselves in a way that is appropriate to the current social situation or interpersonal context, to ensure that others judge them favorably.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, according to the above definition, which of the following is impression management?\n# Options:\nA) The agent of a hong kong star has gone out of his way to increase his popularity by getting more stars to participate in tv entertainment programs.\nB) The chairman of the board criticized manager chen, saying that clients would not have confidence in the company if they saw such a mess in your office every day.\nC) After hearing his classmates secretly say bad things about him, lin couldn't help but go up and beat him.\nD) Before the interview, in order to be hired, xiao li in the clothing, hairstyle and so on has made the careful preparation.", '. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
