rough strategic actions (encouraging participation in TV programs). Therefore, my final answer is A) The agent of a Hong Kong star has gone out of his way to increase his popularity by getting more stars to participate in TV entertainment programs.\n</think>\n<answer>\nA) The agent of a Hong Kong star has gone out of his way to increase his popularity by getting more stars to participate in TV entertainment programs.\n</answer>",
