us quo and get promoted, suggesting a lack of progress and motivation.\n\nBased on the analysis, the correct answer is **D) Wang has been working as an archive administrator for 15 years. He feels numb to his work and has no desire to change the status quo and get promoted**.\n</think>\n<answer>\nD) Wang has been working as an archive administrator for 15 years. He feels numb to his work and has no desire to change the status quo and get promoted.\n</answer>",
