t to redistribute resources via taxation. It focuses on the voluntary nature of helping others.\n\nBased on the analysis, the correct answer is C) Any government that redistributes resources via taxation forces people to help others. This directly contradicts Raphaela's statement and aligns with Edward's perspective.\n</think>\n<answer>\nC) Any government that redistributes resources via taxation forces people to help others.\n</answer>",
