ant results. It suggests that external factors can contribute to success, but it does not negate the importance of ambition.\n\n4. **Option D**: This option states that the chrysanthemum elder sister is neither talented nor beautiful but achieved a prosperous life through her self-confidence and constant effort. This statement does not directly contradict the idea that a little ambition is necessary for ordinary people to achieve significant results. It suggests that self-confidence and effort can lead to success, but it does not negate the importance of ambition.\n\nBased on the analysis, the statement that constitutes a rebuttal to the given statement is **Option B**: \"Although Zhang Xiong had high ambitions, he was mediocre in intelligence. He worked hard all his life, but nothing was accomplished, and he was bruised and bruised all over.\" This statement directly contradicts the idea that a little ambition is necessary for ordinary people to achieve significant results by providing an example of someone with high ambition who did not achieve success due to lack of intelligence.\n</think>\n<answer>\nB) Although Zhang Xiong had high ambitions, he was mediocre in intelligence. He worked hard all his life, but nothing was accomplished, and he was bruised and bruised all over.\n</answer>",
